Clean import of the OpenAPI adapter and consumer qualification sources from
openbindings/sdk at bd3938e47e7cdc5f0c209949cff8c16618c813a6.
Imported path identities and extraction changes are recorded in PROVENANCE.md.

This project depends on the OpenBindings SDK interface contracts and exact JSON/schema
implementation at 3546fc29d3fb329656c6a7506f6006b9eb38375d and on the independent
Apache-2.0 openapi-client at 5cc2cf47ad9a05d1aa3cf968d03841ca9bbded61. It supplies no copy of the SDK itself.
The SDK's private packages carry their own license and notice files, and the
schema copies its schema crate embeds retain their upstream license; these
package-specific notices are reproduced with the other dependencies' notices in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt.

DEPENDENCIES.json lists this repository's actual locked Cargo graph, including
platform and development dependencies, and its TypeScript 5.9.3 development tool.
It records declared license expressions, source identities and notice hashes.
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt reproduces the license/notice files found in those cached
package sources. This attribution inventory is not a claim that every listed
package is part of every runtime build.
